    "result_text": "`AcceptanceTest` is the only test class, and the full suite is green.\n\n## Summary\n\nImplemented the `ownerSegment` derived field on the Owner API response, formatted `<TIER>_<AREA>`.\n\n**Changes:**\n\n1. **`src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerSegments.java`** (new) \u2014 helper deriving the segment:\n   - `TIER` = `PREMIUM` when `MembershipLevels.forOwner(owner) >= 3`, else `STANDARD`.\n   - `AREA` = `METRO` when `CustomerCodes.localityOf(owner)` is a known region (NSW, VIC, QLD), else `REGIONAL`.\n   - Reuses the existing level and locality derivations so it stays consistent with the `membershipLevel`/`locality` fields.\n\n2. **`src/main/java/org/springframework/samples/petclinic/mapper/OwnerMapper.java`** \u2014 added a MapStruct `@Mapping` for `ownerSegment` wired to `OwnerSegments.forOwner`.\n\n3. **`src/main/resources/openapi.yml`** \u2014 added the `ownerSegment` read-only string property to the `Owner` schema (which generates `OwnerDto`), documenting the four possible values.\n\nBoth acceptance tests pass (`STANDARD_METRO` for a known-region owner, `STANDARD_REGIONAL` for an unknown region), and the full build is green.",
